# TypeOK pairing: a propagated change installs a policy outside the model.
MODULE: TypeOKPropagateUndeclaredPolicy
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: propagation installs an undeclared policy
PERTURBS: Propagate

--- FIND
    /\ seen # pol /\ seen' = pol
--- REPLACE
    /\ seen # pol /\ seen' = 3
--- END